# Trading core quality

## Smoke checks (from `apps/api`)

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
python -c "from app.main import app"
```

## Runtime

- `GET /health` — process up.
- `GET /eod/status`, `POST /eod/master/refresh-if-due` — per `RUNBOOK.md`.

## Documentation

- Keep **`docs/API_BUILD_ORDER.md`** in sync with implemented routes.
- When behavior affects the Next.js BFF, note alignment with the consumer’s API contract.

## CI

If `.github/workflows/ci.yml` is present, it should install requirements under `apps/api` and run the import smoke command. Add pytest later under `apps/api/tests/` when the suite exists.
